  "limitations": [
    "Candidate: public build 060d85a (rc3), a sanitized export of SpaceApp release/1.1.7-rc3 7619ef9523 (stable 77d00f6895, the 1.1.7 release-train candidate, plus the reviewed desktop sign-in fix and quality register lines) with the 1.1.7 overlay commits: OpenCode 2 (@opencode/cli 2.0.32) as the first CLI with its own update check off, the core without OpenCode (credential agent), the MIT licence, integrity pins, the consistent backup with a restore that puts everything back on failure, the Codex sessions mount and the fixes of the internal 1.1.7 review listed in the CHANGELOG.",
    "Tested artifacts: launcher run-spaceapp-1.1.7.tgz sha256 b3dec1aa3630d6a2273e8300ab7cf5347d2e45d05daf5f5db8e48955614fd9fb; images by ID from the archive images-1.1.7.tar.gz sha256 d8d7f8490972355bbf72debb9776e85391d9cdcc8a06f1fde49e29d192dc1fa1: core sha256:e4fc11ce4c21286f97c45a05782b9205f6fda227537a10e11653b111d93333a9, cli sha256:f5b440eea96191f13a0b84e0654defc531586d9790c36431cb1262680b81827f, browser sha256:8d690a03bdcc4cc6f059753cff8e61fcc526f5f6096ab2b9506c174ebbb86359. The release workflow rebuilds the images from this source (IR117-C-F7).",
    "VM hosts are x86_64. ARM64 container validation remains a release workflow gate.",
    "Fresh installer timings use preloaded local candidate images; they exclude network image downloads.",
